      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:1:3:26:2",
      "text": [
        " قُلْتُ لِأَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) شَاءَ وَ أَرَادَ وَ قَدَّرَ وَ قَضَى قَالَ نَعَمْ قُلْتُ وَ أَحَبَّ قَالَ لَا قُلْتُ وَ كَيْفَ شَاءَ وَ أَرَادَ وَ قَدَّرَ وَ قَضَى وَ لَمْ يُحِبَّ قَالَ هَكَذَا خَرَجَ إِلَيْنَا ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from Muhammad Bin Isa, from Yunus Bin Abdul Rahman, from Aban, from Abu Baseer who said, ",
          "‘I said to Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, ‘(He<sup>azwj</sup>) ‘شَاءَ وَ أَرَادَ وَ قَدَّرَ وَ قَضَى’ Desires, and Intends, and Determines and Ordains?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Yes’. I said, ‘And He<sup>azwj</sup> Loves?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘No’. I said, ‘And how does He<sup>azwj</sup> Desires, and Intends, and Determines, and Ordains, and He<sup>azwj</sup> does not Love?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘This is how it has come out to us<sup>asws</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          " 2. It is narrated from Ali ibn Ibrahim from Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from Yunus ibn ‘Abd al-Rahman from Aban from abu Basir who has said the following. “asked abu ‘Abdallah (a.s.) about, “(Allah) Wished, Willed, Measured and Decreed.” The Imam said, “Yes.” I asked, “Did He love?” The Imam said, “No.” I asked, “How is it that He wished, willed measured and decreed but did not love?” The Imam said, “This is how it has come to us.”"
        ]
      }
    },
